from m6-rotom-chateau.replay
# Event branch m6-event-rotom (docs/decisions.md: the dev-only
# event flag; docs/research/postgame.md §7): the Secret Key distribution (`event rotom`: VAR_DISTRIBUTION_EVENT_ROTOM's
# magic number and the key) with the Rotom caught in m6-rotom-chateau. In the Galactic Eterna Building the key opens
# the wall to Rotom's room; its on-transition shows the five appliances (get_rotom_forms_in_save: none in the save).
# Into the microwave: get_party_rotom_count_and_first 0, YES, set_rotom_form Heat: Overheat into a free slot, the form
# in the Pokédex, the microwave gone; the warp in place starts Rowan's visit (FLAG_USED_ROTOM_APPLIANCE, state 2). A
# reload keeps Heat Rotom; the appliance spot's RECALL brings it back to its base form, Overheat forgotten.
event rotom
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_TEAM_GALACTIC_ETERNA_BUILDING_1F 2 5 left
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until idle 600
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROTOMS_ROOM" 600
+0 release up
until idle 600
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ROTOMS_ROOM_MICROWAVE false
+0 press up
until position 7 7 6000
+0 release up
+0 press left
until position 4 7 6000
+0 release left
until idle 60
+0 press up
+1 release up
until idle 60
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 6000
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app summary 600
+1 tap move:3
+1 tap move:3
until app none 600
advance text 3000
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 6000
until idle 6000
+0 assert state party[5].form 1
+0 assert state party[5].moves[3] "platinum:MOVE_OVERHEAT"
+0 assert state party[5].ability "platinum:ABILITY_LEVITATE"
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_USED_ROTOM_APPLIANCE true
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_ROTOMS_ROOM_STATE 2
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ROTOMS_ROOM_MICROWAVE true
+0 reload
+0 assert state party[5].form 1
+0 press up
+1 release up
until idle 60
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 600
until menu 600
+10 press a
+1 release a
advance text 6000
until idle 6000
+0 assert state party[5].form 0
+0 assert state party[5].moves ["platinum:MOVE_THUNDER_SHOCK","platinum:MOVE_CONFUSE_RAY","platinum:MOVE_UPROAR"]
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ROTOMS_ROOM_MICROWAVE false
